## Context
Beyond accuracy: can the pipeline handle real-world messiness? Gap-fill
from aggregate constraints, detect incoherences, prioritize conflicting
sources. This is what makes it usable for statistical production.

## Actions
1. Gap-filling from aggregate constraints (total capacity known, fill units)
2. Incoherence detection and escalation protocol
3. Source prioritization when references conflict

## Exit criteria
- Gap-filling produces plausible completions from constraints
- Incoherences flagged and escalated (not silently resolved)
- Source conflicts resolved with documented priority rules
